# Reference list of the environment variables this project uses. Nothing loads a .env
# file: there is no dotenv dependency, so copying this to .env.local has no effect.
# The TAGALONG_* variables below are read straight from the shell; every API key is entered
# in Settings and stored through Electron safeStorage, never from here.

# OpenRouter API key, for Scout on the 'openrouter' provider (https://openrouter.ai/api/v1).
# NOT read from here: enter it in Settings → Advanced → API keys. Listed for reference only.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Anthropic Console API key, for Scout on the 'anthropic' provider. NOT read from here: enter
# it in Settings → Advanced → API keys. Listed for reference only.
# A Claude subscription needs no key: Scout can think with your Claude sign-in instead (the
# 'claude-code' provider runs the claude CLI you are signed in to).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ElevenLabs API key, for Scout's optional ElevenLabs voice. NOT read from here: enter it in
# Settings → Advanced → ElevenLabs voice, with a voice ID from your library. Listed for reference only.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Makes Scout's voice a short silent clip: no voice model download, no ElevenLabs call, no sound.
# Set by the Electron smoke tests; set it yourself to run without hearing Scout.
TAGALONG_FAKE_TTS=

# Talk to Scout hears "What am I looking at?" every time, through Chromium's fake microphone:
# no speech model download and no real microphone. Set by the Electron smoke tests.
TAGALONG_FAKE_STT=

